      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEY BARBIE GIRL (6) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (30.20) at this track. Has good speed so she should be prominent despite the draw. Has ability and can bounce back. MIA'S MIRAGE (4) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at this track over 401m behind Going Broke (23.58) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Has ability and is one of the better chances. IT'S ALL BAD (2) goes very well at the course with two wins and a placing from four starts. Placed last time (26.68) at Bulli in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 8 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. NO SHAME (8) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
